BINDERY BOX / MUFI Box
======================

This product reconstructs its front-end core on top of Claw3D, an open-source
3D virtual AI-office built with Next.js, React, Three.js and React Three Fiber.

  Claw3D
  https://github.com/iamlukethedev/Claw3D
